sylve-cli provides a command-line interface (sylve) for managing Sylve
FreeBSD virtualization clusters, Bhyve virtual machines, FreeBSD jails,
ZFS storage pools and snapshots, network switches/firewalls, downloads,
HA replication policies, cluster backups, and node draining.

It supports multi-context CLI authentication with persistent session tokens
and automatic cluster-wide request routing across all nodes.
